---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Ruckus Systems"
  description="Terms governing use of ruckussystems.dev, including website content, online booking, and third-party tools."
>
  <div class="privacy-root">
    <a href="/" class="privacy-back-link">← Back to Home</a>

    <article class="privacy-main">
      <h1 class="privacy-title">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="privacy-meta">
        <strong>Ruckus Systems LLC</strong> · Effective June 2026 ·
        <a href="mailto:jared@ruckussystems.dev">jared@ruckussystems.dev</a>
      </p>
      <p class="privacy-meta">
        See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Agreement</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using <a href="https://ruckussystems.dev">ruckussystems.dev</a>, you
          agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Website &amp; services</h2>
        <p>
          This site is the public marketing website for Ruckus Systems LLC, offering
          information about software development, data engineering, and AI automation
          consulting. The site may also provide optional online booking for consultations and
          related services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the site for unlawful, harmful, or harassing purposes.</li>
          <li>Attempt to disrupt, scrape, or gain unauthorized access to the site or its systems.</li>
          <li>Introduce malware, automated abuse, or interference with other users.</li>
          <li>Misrepresent your identity or affiliation when booking or contacting us.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Booking</h2>
        <p>
          When you book a session, you agree to provide accurate contact information and to
          follow cancellation, rescheduling, and attendance policies presented in the booking
          flow. We may decline or cancel bookings that violate these terms or appear
          fraudulent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Site content, branding, design, and materials are owned by Ruckus Systems LLC or its
          licensors and are protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not
          copy, modify, or redistribute site content without prior written permission, except
          for personal, non-commercial viewing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Third-party links &amp; tools</h2>
        <p>
          The site may link to third-party services or use tools such as analytics,
          scheduling, and payment processors. Those services are governed by their own terms
          and privacy policies. Ruckus Systems is not responsible for third-party content or
          practices.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          Site content is provided for general informational purposes. It does not constitute
          professional, legal, financial, or technical advice. You rely on site information at
          your own risk.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          The site and related services are provided <strong>as is</strong> and
          <strong>as available</strong>, without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent
          permitted by law, Ruckus Systems LLC will not be liable for indirect, incidental,
          special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of the site,
          including booking or payment interactions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="privacy-section">
        <h2>Changes &amp; contact</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms by posting changes on this page. Continued use after
          updates constitutes acceptance. Questions:
          <a href="mailto:jared@ruckussystems.dev">jared@ruckussystems.dev</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <p class="privacy-disclaimer">
        These terms govern use of ruckussystems.dev. They do not constitute legal advice and
        may be updated from time to time.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-root {
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .privacy-back-link:hover {
    color: var(--solar-blue);
  }

  .privacy-main {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-main {
      padding: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .privacy-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-meta {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .privacy-meta a {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .privacy-meta a:hover {
    color: var(--solar-blue);
  }

  .privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacy-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .privacy-section p,
  .privacy-section li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .privacy-section a {
    color: var(--solar-blue);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .privacy-section a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .privacy-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
</style>
